#### C-3 · `trust proxy` SET TO `1` (UNCONDITIONALLY)

**File:** `server/app.js` — line `app.set('trust proxy', 1)`

Setting `trust proxy` globally means any `X-Forwarded-For` header sent by a client can be trusted, allowing **IP spoofing to bypass rate limiting**. This should only be enabled in production on Vercel/behind a known proxy.

