#### H-5 · `bill.controller.js` — `createBill` DOES NOT VALIDATE `unitPrice` FOR CUSTOM ITEMS

When `item.menuItem` is not provided (custom line item), `unitPrice` comes raw from `req.body.items[*].unitPrice`. There is no minimum check — a price of `0` or `-1` is accepted, producing a corrupted bill total.

